---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About us" description="About Navis Maritime Solutions: a multi-disciplinary maritime consultancy and project management firm in Dubai, safeguarding shipowners' capital and vessel performance." nav="about" page="about">

  <section class="hero page ph-about">
    <div class="hero-inner"><div class="wrap rise">
      <span class="tag">About us</span>
      <h1>About <em>Navis</em></h1>
      <p class="sub">Engineered to Execute. Trusted to Deliver.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
  <div class="body">
    <section class="sec reveal">
      <div class="wrap split intro-split">
        <div><span class="eyebrow">About Navis Maritime Solutions</span><p class="statement" style="margin-top:18px">A premier, multi-disciplinary maritime consultancy and project management firm dedicated to safeguarding shipowners capital and optimizing vessel lifecycle performance.</p><p class="intro-body">Founded on the principles of engineering precision, operational transparency and regulatory integrity, we serve as the vital technical bridge connecting shipowners, operators, shipyards and naval architects. We understand that in high-stakes marine environments, asset protection and time-to-market are everything. Whether managing a complex vessel conversion, overseeing a critical dry-docking cycle or sourcing IACS-certified machinery, Navis Maritime Solutions delivers elite technical oversight that mitigates risk, controls costs and keeps global fleets moving safely.</p></div>
        <div class="ph-wrap"><div class="ph plate"><img src="/images/about-deck.jpg" alt="View along a tanker's deck towards the sunrise at sea" loading="lazy"></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec vm-band vm-ship reveal">
      <div class="wrap vm2 vm-gap">
        <div class="vm-card plate"><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To be the premier global anchor for maritime project execution, recognized for seamlessly bridging engineering precision, shipyard operations and asset owner commercial interests to deliver high-performance, future-ready vessels.</p></div>
        <div class="vm-card plate"><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To safeguard shipowners&#39; capital and assets through world-class project management, certified marine equipment supply and elite technical representation. By combining rigorous engineering oversight with transparent shipyard collaboration, we eliminate operational friction, control dry-docking costs and ensure every vessel returns to sea on schedule, fully compliant and commercially optimized.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec navyband reveal">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">The Navis Commitment</span><h2>We manage technical complexity</h2></div><p>We do not just manage timelines; we manage technical complexity. Every engagement we undertake is driven by four core professional pillars.</p></div>
        <div class="pillars2">
          <div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">01</div><h3>Operational Transparency &amp; Cost Integrity</h3><p>We act as your eyes and ears on the shipyard floor. From initial steel weight estimates to final invoice cross-checking, we provide data-driven cost validation to eliminate budget overruns.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">02</div><h3>Uncompromising Classification Standards</h3><p>Every design drawing we facilitate and every spare component we source strictly adheres to IACS classification rules and international IMO mandates, securing long-term asset value.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">03</div><h3>Zero-Downtime Supply Chain Excellence</h3><p>A ship out of service is a ship losing revenue. Our logistical network is engineered to source certified, class-approved marine equipment and critical spares with absolute urgency.</p></div><div class="pillar plate"><div class="n">04</div><h3>Engineering-Backed Execution</h3><p>By integrating advanced commercial naval architecture design support with practical, on-site shipyard representation, we ensure complex retrofits and new builds pass structural audits the first time.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sec reveal" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="ctabox plate"><h2>Have a project in mind? Let&#39;s make it easy.</h2><a class="btn dark plate" href="/contact/">Get in touch <span class="ar">→</span></a></div></div>
</section>
    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
